    "rules_provenance": null,
    "source_rule_excerpts": [
      "No. The asQ is a dichotomous screen, not a count or a sum. A ‘Yes’ to any one of the four core items produces a positive screen, and endorsing additional items does not change the result category or generate a higher score. The four core items were derived from a larger candidate pool and retained because, together , they form a brief, highly sensitive set — not because any one is individually weighted, so no single core item is treated as “better” or “worse” than another."
    ],
